            "Exit after 12 months (2 points): NPV_bad = −658,144, NPV = 398,044, so the right is worth 27,426 more.",
            "Bonus: the extra value equals the avoided losses of months 13 to 24, 0.5 × 5,000 × (a24 − a12)."
